{"nodes": [{"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_service_discovery", "label": "Service Discovery", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "rationale": "Instance IPs change constantly as services scale, so hardcoding is impossible; a central registry acts like an always-updated phone book. Described as a load balancer for internal services with a changing instance count."}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_service_registry", "label": "Service Registry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "rationale": "Instances register themselves, send heartbeats, and are removed automatically when heartbeats stop."}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_heartbeat", "label": "Heartbeat", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_server_side_discovery", "label": "Server-Side Discovery", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "rationale": "As described: the gateway consults the registry on every call; simpler for clients but the registry takes more load."}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_client_side_discovery", "label": "Client-Side Discovery", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "rationale": "Each client keeps a copy of the instance list and load-balances itself, lowering registry load but making clients smarter."}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_self_registration", "label": "Self-Registration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "rationale": "Instance contains code to register itself and heartbeat; straightforward but every service embeds registry logic."}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_third_party_registration", "label": "Third-Party Registration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "rationale": "An orchestrator observes instances being born or dying and registers them on their behalf, reducing coupling between services and the registry."}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_dns_based_discovery", "label": "DNS-Based Discovery", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "rationale": "Stable DNS name per service resolves to healthy instance IPs so clients never talk to a registry API directly."}, {"id": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_kubernetes", "label": "Kubernetes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null}], "edges": [{"source": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_service_discovery", "target": "src_content_module_07_03_api_gateway_api_gateway", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_service_discovery", "target": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_service_registry", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_service_registry", "target": "src_content_module_07_04_service_discovery_heartbeat", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-07/04-service-discovery.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_content_m